|YKB'A snake glides upon the ground as if they are not subject
to friction or gravity.'|WKO - |RKBLady Tung
|YK0
A trained Monk in the Kir Brotherhood is able to make their
own body light enough that they actually walk on water.
This often amazes the untrained, as they believe that this is
impossible. This skill would indeed be impossible if one
is not able to channel the Energy of the Ancients.

|MKBThis is a Master of the South Wind power.

